    "headline": "ADP’s (NASDAQ:ADP) Q2 CY2026 Sales Beat Estimates",
    "summary": "Payroll and HR services provider Automatic Data Processing (NASDAQ:ADP) announced better-than-expected revenue in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 6.8% year on year to $5.47 billion. Its non-GAAP profit of $2.64 per share was 1.6% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
